<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Furman starts Disney.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Furman starts Disney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said analyst Stewart Halpern initiated coverage of Walt Disney Co, adding the stock to the firm's recommended list and putting a 12-month $100 price target on the shares.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up one to 77-7/16.</p>
